{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T09:41:05.258834", "data": {"url": "https://www.policybazaar.com/gold-rate/", "title": "Today Gold Rate: 22 & 24 Carat Gold Price in India: 28 July 2026", "content": "Gold Rates in India Gold holds a special place in Indian culture, especially among women, and is considered both auspicious and valuable. In India, gold is not only cherished for its traditional and emotional significance but also valued as a reliable investment asset. The price of gold fluctuates daily due to factors such as global market trends, inflation, rupee-dollar exchange rate, and demand-supply dynamics. Whether it's in the form of jewellery, coins, or bars, staying updated with the current gold rate is essential for making informed purchases. Beyond physical gold, investors now also explore gold trading through commodities and derivatives on exchanges. Read More 24K 22K Live Gram Today ( -1.98% ) Yesterday 1 Gram \u20b9 13,997 \u20b9 14,280 8 Gram \u20b9 1,11,976 \u20b9 1,14,240 10 Gram \u20b9 1,39,970 \u20b9 1,42,800 12 Gram (1 Tola) \u20b9 1,67,964 \u20b9 1,71,360 Gram Today ( -1.98% ) Yesterday 1 Gram \u20b9 13,330 \u20b9 13,600 8 Gram \u20b9 1,06,640 \u20b9 1,08,800 10 Gram \u20b9 1,33,300 \u20b9 1,36,000 12 Gram (1 Tola) \u20b9 1,59,960 \u20b9 1,63,200 +91 We don\u2019t spam Why we need your mobile number? View Plans Your personal information is secure with us By clicking on \" View Plans \" you agree to our Privacy Policy and Terms of use Tax benefit is subject to changes in tax laws Get Updates on WhatsApp Disclaimer: #The investment risk in the portfolio is borne by the policyholder. Life insurance is available in this product. The maturity amount of Rs 1 Cr. is for a 30 year old healthy individual investing Rs 10,000/- per month for 30 years, with assumed rates of returns @ 8% p.a. that is not guaranteed and is not the upper or lower limits as the value of your policy depends on a number of factors including future investment performance. In Unit Linked Insurance Plans, the investment risk in the investment portfolio is borne by the policyholder and the returns are not guaranteed. Maturity Value: \u20b91,05,02,174 @ CAGR 8%; \u20b950,45,591 @ CAGR 4%. *Tax benefits and savings are subject to changes in tax laws. All plans listed here are of insurance companies\u2019 funds. The tax benefits under Section 80C allow a deduction of up to \u20b91.5 lakhs from the taxable income per year and 10(10D) tax benefits are for investments made up to \u20b92.5 Lakhs/ year for policies bought after 1 Feb 2021. Tax benefits and savings are subject to changes in tax laws. Read More Home Gold Rate Abohar Adilabad Adoni Agartala Agra Ahmedabad Ahmednagar Aizawl Ajmer Akola Aligarh Allahabad Alwar Ambala Ambarnath Ambikapur Ambur Amravati Amreli Amritsar Anand Anantapur Asansol Aurangabad Ayodhya Badlapur Bagalkot Bahadurgarh Balangir Balasore Balurghat Bangalore Bankura Bareilly Baripada Barnala Barshi Batala Bathinda Beawar Belgaum Bellary Berhampur Betul Bhadrak Bhagalpur Bharatpur Bharuch Bhavnagar Bhilwara Bhimavaram Bhind Bhiwadi Bhiwandi Bhiwani Bhopal Bhubaneswar Bhuj Bhusawal Bidar Bikaner Bilaspur Budaun Burhanpur Chandigarh Chandrapur Chennai Chhatarpur Chhindwara Chikmagalur Chilakaluripet Chirala Chitradurga Chittoor Coimbatore Cuddalore Cuttack Darjeeling Deesa Dehradun Delhi Deoghar Dewas Dhanbad Dharamshala Dharmavaram Dhule Dibrugarh Dindigul Dispur Durgapur Eluru Erode Faridabad Faridkot Farrukhabad Firozabad Gandhidham Gandhinagar Gangavathi Gangtok Gaya Ghaziabad Giridih Goa Godhra Gondia Gorakhpur Gudivada Gudiyatham Gujarat Guna Guntakal Guntur Gurgaon Guwahati Gwalior Hanumangarh Hassan Hazaribagh Hindupur Hinganghat Hisar Hoshiarpur Hospet Hosur Howrah Hyderabad Ichalkaranji Imphal Indore Itarsi Jabalpur Jagdalpur Jagtial Jaipur Jalandhar Jalgaon Jalna Jalpaiguri Jammu Jamnagar Jamshedpur Jhansi Jind Jodhpur Jorhat Junagadh Kadapa Kadiri Kaithal Kakinada Kalyan Kanchipuram Kannur Kanpur Kapurthala Karaikudi Karimnag